Package: peruflora
Title: Integrate Peruvian Flora Taxonomy and Conservation Sources
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Paul E.", "Santos Andrade", , "paulefrens@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6635-0375"))
Description: Cross-references plant names against four independent Peruvian
    flora packages covering CITES listings, current endemic taxa, the historical
    Red Book of endemic plants, and Supreme Decree 043-2006-AG. Returns
    source-level matching evidence and a compact summary while retaining
    uncertainty and source provenance, flags approximate names for manual review,
    and offers an optional 'Shiny' application for batch queries and file exports.
